BEGIN
  WITH descriptions(catalogue_ref, detail_description) AS (
    VALUES
    ('P-F030', 'From behind a closed window in the Cotswolds, soft robin phrases drift from a distant hedgerow in the early morning. The room gently softens each call, giving you a quiet indoor perspective on the garden while you ease into reading, emails or everyday work. By leaving out human activity or other birds crowding the mix, the scene gives its quieter details room to breathe and remains uncluttered rather than busy or unpredictable. For light admin and preference-led focus, Distant Garden Birdsong offers enough texture to hold the background while leaving your attention free to remain with the task in front of you.'),
    ('P-S042', 'Imagine being beneath the water beside the Great Barrier Reef, surrounded by deep, muffled movement and faint natural reef crackle. The softly enclosed underwater texture creates a quiet nighttime escape for resting, without the breathing sounds of a diver. The scene leaves out boats or loud clicks, allowing the central sounds to develop at an even pace without an abrupt distraction taking over the listening space. During quiet bedtime listening, Underwater at the Great Barrier Reef offers a predictable sense of place that can remain softly present while the rest of the day begins to recede.'),
    ('P-S046', 'Inside a shallow Portuguese sea cave at night, slow ocean swells move through the chamber with a hollow echo. Water drains softly back after each rise, creating a spacious, gently repeating coastal atmosphere as you settle towards sleep. The night setting is heard from a sheltered listening point, keeping the experience connected as its steady pattern continues. You will not hear booming impacts or gulls; the natural rhythm remains clear, spacious, and easy to keep in the background for longer stretches. Waves in a Portuguese Sea Cave suits quiet bedtime listening by keeping the listening experience calm and consistent, with enough detail to feel immersive without becoming demanding.'),
    ('P-F056', 'At sunrise in the New Forest, woodland birds call from several distances, their phrases overlapping across a quiet clearing. Soft woodland ambience rests between the calls, offering an open, living background for reading or working if you enjoy birdsong nearby. The listening space stays clear of human activity or close alarm calls, so each subtle change can arrive gently and pass without demanding a response or close attention. Used for reading and sustained desk work, Birdsong in the New Forest creates a consistent surrounding atmosphere that can accompany concentration without competing with it.'),
    ('P-S053', 'From a sheltered outdoor spot at night, gentle rain spreads evenly across the surrounding ground. Individual details blend into a broad, soft wash, creating a simple rainy atmosphere to accompany a slower pace and quiet rest. The foreground remains free of thunder or close drips, preserving the scene''s calm balance and letting its softer textures carry the atmosphere from moment to moment. For quiet bedtime listening, the restrained atmosphere of Gentle Rain can sit quietly in the room, giving attention a gentle place to settle as the day winds down.'),
    ('P-S002', 'Inside a Norwegian ferry cabin at night, soft engine vibration blends with a low wash of water against the hull. The steady enclosed hum gives the journey an unhurried feel, offering a quiet companion to your bedtime routine. Without horns or announcements interrupting the setting, the sound holds a measured shape that feels present without becoming intrusive or overly active around you. During quiet bedtime listening, Norwegian Ferry Cabin at Night offers a predictable sense of place that can remain softly present while the rest of the day begins to recede.'),
    ('P-F032', 'At the edge of a geothermal mud pool in Rotorua, small rounded bubbles break the surface with soft, irregular plops. A quiet underlying geothermal wash connects these details, offering a gently active atmosphere for light work as the day begins. By leaving out human activity or loud pops, the scene gives its quieter details room to breathe and remains uncluttered rather than busy or unpredictable. Bubbling Mud Pools is especially suited to light admin and preference-led focus, bringing a steady sense of place while your main attention stays with whatever you are doing.'),
    ('P-S006', 'In a bedroom aboard a moored houseboat, small hollow laps of water meet the hull while the boat moves gently on still water. The engine is quiet, leaving an intimate waterside rhythm to accompany the end of the day. The scene leaves out passing engines or rope knocks, allowing the central sounds to develop at an even pace without an abrupt distraction taking over the listening space. Chosen for quiet bedtime listening, Night on a Houseboat can accompany the transition into rest with an atmosphere that stays composed and easy to leave in the background.'),
    ('P-S033', 'Beneath a thick bank of Alpine snow, a small stream continues to flow with a low, muffled murmur. Fine water details remain softly tucked into the sound, creating a sheltered winter-night atmosphere to accompany quiet rest. You will not hear snow collapse or sharp drips; the natural rhythm remains clear, spacious, and easy to keep in the background for longer stretches. For quiet bedtime listening, the restrained atmosphere of Alpine Stream beneath the Snow can sit quietly in the room, giving attention a gentle place to settle as the day winds down.'),
    ('P-S017', 'From a quiet bedroom facing Tuscan grassland, fine cricket pulses repeat across the summer night. Their overlapping texture remains soft and distant, offering a gentle outdoor presence as you leave the day behind and prepare to rest. The listening space stays clear of dogs or bells, so each subtle change can arrive gently and pass without demanding a response or close attention. During quiet bedtime listening, Summer Crickets in Tuscany offers a predictable sense of place that can remain softly present while the rest of the day begins to recede.'),
    ('P-S050', 'White noise fills the background with a bright, steady hiss and an even, continuous texture. With no changing scene to follow, it offers a simple listening option for bedtime when you prefer a uniform sound around you. The any time setting is heard without a fixed physical viewpoint, keeping the experience connected as its steady pattern continues. The foreground remains free of tones or pulses, preserving the scene''s calm balance and letting its softer textures carry the atmosphere from moment to moment. White Noise suits quiet bedtime listening by keeping the listening experience calm and consistent, with enough detail to feel immersive without becoming demanding.'),
