    ('P-F050', 'A fast-moving Alpine stream tumbles over closely spaced stones, filling the scene with a dense, continuous rush. Small eddies overlap beneath the brighter water sounds, offering an energetic natural background for a focused daytime session. The daytime setting is heard from a sheltered listening point, keeping the experience connected as its natural variation pattern continues. The listening space stays clear of isolated loud splashes or birds, so each subtle change can arrive gently and pass without demanding a response or close attention. Used for reading and sustained desk work, Rushing Alpine Stream creates a consistent surrounding atmosphere that can accompany concentration without competing with it.'),
    ('P-F001', 'Settle into an enclosed carriage on a journey through Tohoku, Japan, where the smooth hiss of the wheels blends with a gentle cabin hum. The even flow of ventilation keeps the afternoon atmosphere steady, offering a quiet travelling backdrop for reading or working through a task. The foreground remains free of human activity or station stops, preserving the scene''s calm balance and letting its softer textures carry the atmosphere from moment to moment. For reading and sustained desk work, Bullet Train through Japan offers enough texture to hold the background while leaving your attention free to remain with the task in front of you.'),
    ('P-R004', 'A spring morning in a wetland inspired by the Danube Delta carries reed-bird chatter across still water. Light water movements sit beneath the distant calls, creating a gently animated marshland scene for stepping away from a busy day and listening at leisure. Without human activity or boat engines interrupting the setting, the sound holds a measured shape that feels present without becoming intrusive or overly active around you. During unwinding and place immersion, the atmosphere of Springtime Marsh gives you somewhere unhurried to place your attention while the surrounding moment grows quieter.'),
    ('P-F003', 'Imagine a morning journey along the Danube through Austria''s Wachau region, heard from behind the glass of an electric riverboat cabin. A fine motor whirr meets the steady hiss of water at the bow, forming a smooth background for a focused stretch of desk work. By leaving out human activity or docking, the scene gives its quieter details room to breathe and remains uncluttered rather than busy or unpredictable. Riverboat on the Danube is especially suited to reading and sustained desk work, bringing a steady sense of place while your main attention stays with whatever you are doing.'),
    ('P-S057', 'Crickets fill a sheltered pine clearing after dark, with occasional owl hoots sounding from farther away. Soft movement passes through the canopy above, bringing a gently living woodland atmosphere to your evening wind-down. The night setting is heard from a sheltered listening point, keeping the experience connected as its gentle natural variation pattern continues. The scene leaves out close owl cries or branch snaps, allowing the central sounds to develop at an even pace without an abrupt distraction taking over the listening space. Chosen for quiet bedtime listening, Nighttime Forest can accompany the transition into rest with an atmosphere that stays composed and easy to leave in the background.'),
    ('P-F018', 'Along a low bank in Finland''s Kainuu forests, a wide river carries a deep, even rush through the summer afternoon. Subtle bubbles from a shoreline eddy add detail beneath the current, offering a full, continuous water background for time spent concentrating. You will not hear human activity or birds; the natural rhythm remains clear, spacious, and easy to keep in the background for longer stretches. For reading and sustained desk work, Deep Forest River offers enough texture to hold the background while leaving your attention free to remain with the task in front of you.')
) AS descriptions(catalogue_ref, detail_description)
WHERE s.catalogue_ref = descriptions.catalogue_ref;

